# VHS recording for the Circle gallery
Output examples/vhs/generated/circle.gif

Set Theme "Aardvark Blue"
Set Width 568
Set Height 810
Set Padding 30
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type "target/release/examples/readme circle"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Radius/
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot target/vhs/circle.png
Sleep 2s
